course: dictionary
lesson: 2975
title: Dryer: one word, several meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A dryer is a machine that dries things. Read the words around it to see which kind is meant. «Clothes stick together after the tumble dryer» tells you it dries clothes. A tumble dryer is the big machine for clothes.
explain: A hair dryer is a smaller machine that blows hot air to dry hair. A hand dryer does the same job for your hands. The word in front, tumble, hair or hand, is the clue that tells you which kind is meant.
explain: Drier, or dryer, can also be the comparison of dry, meaning more dry. «More dry» is the meaning there. Check the sentence: if it makes sense to say "more dry", the word is the comparison.
fact: A dryer is a machine that dries things, such as clothes.
fact: A hair dryer blows hot air to dry hair.
fact: Never use a hair dryer near water, such as a bath or sink, because it can give you an electric shock.
fact: Never play inside a dryer or a washing machine. «A girl in Ohio climbed into the dryer during hide-and-seek» and could not get out.
fact: Clean the lint (fluff) filter, because fluff can catch fire.
exercise: «Put the wet towels in the dryer.» What is a dryer? | *A machine that dries things | A cupboard for shoes | A kind of soap for washing hands
exercise: «A hair dryer blows hot air.» What does a hair dryer do? | *It blows hot air to dry hair | It cuts hair short | It washes hair with soap
exercise: Which word is the comparison of dry, meaning more dry? | dryness | dries | *drier | dryly
test: «Electric heaters, hair dryers and plugged-in things must never be near a bath or sink of water.» Why? | To make the mirror clear | To help the taps run faster | To keep the bath warm | *To stop an electric shock from water
test: «Never play inside a dryer or washing machine.» What must you not do? | *Play inside it | Clean its lint filter | Dry your hair near it | Put wet clothes in it
exam: Which is a machine that dries clothes? | a washing line | *a tumble dryer | a dryer sheet | a bath towel
